INSERT INTO posts (title, slug, content, excerpt, image_url, categories, tags, author, wp_id, published, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES ('Ireland has found the key to measuring the qualitative community work with individuals', 'how-meeting-a-community-worker-can-change-your-lifes-journey', 'Ireland has found the key to measuring the qualitative community work with individuals.

&nbsp;

We’re all on a journey, but meeting a community worker can change everything for the good.

The message from General Election 2020 was that people wanted change, but how do we change ourselves as individuals? It happens through having goals and ambitions, knowing our strengths and weaknesses, getting guidance and most of all opportunities.

Often, a conversation with the right person at the right time can open doors. To jobs, education and to whatever it is that we need at different points in life.

Community development workers are among those who provide people with guidance and now they have a simple tool that makes the road ahead easier for people, because they can see their progress along the way. The tool is unique too in fulfilling a desire among community workers to have their “soft outcomes” work measured and valued.

The “My Journey Distance Travelled Tool” is a single sheet of paper with 27 questions that can be filled out in minutes and it has been validated at the highest level as an intervention that can measure progress.

IT WAS DEV''D BY...

&nbsp;

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pu0uc7yQytA

&nbsp;', '20 years ago they dreamed about this. Now, community development workers have it - a tool that measures the value of their work with individuals on journey. The ripple effects of this will be felt by communities across Ireland.', '', '[{"slug":"uncategorized","title":"Uncategorized"}]', '[{"slug":"changingireland","title":"#ChangingIreland"}]', 'Allen Meagher', 248848, 0, '2020-02-12T10:10:00Z', '2020-02-12T10:10:00Z')
